The '''Great Spook''' is an annual [[event]].

== Mechanics ==
Each '''Great Spook''' takes place in real-life October and lasts for about two weeks, with the exact start time varying. During the '''Great Spook''', the amount of [[Spooky Festival]]s are usually increased and several exclusive NPCs and mobs spawn.

=== Tyashoi Alchemist ===
{{Main|Tyashoi Alchemist}}
During the event, the {{NPCSprite|Tyashoi Alchemist}} appears. Players who are at least {{skill|Combat| 10}} and have {{Green|10}} hours of playtime can participate in their questline to obtain various exclusive items and the {{Item|Eerie Pet}}.

=== Primal Fears ===
{{Main|Primal Fear}}
During the '''Great Spook''', killing a mob has a small chance to spawn {{MobSprite|Primal Fear;Primal Fears}}. Once killed, they spawn a manifestation where, in order to be killed, a player must perform a specific action depending on the manifestation spawned. Once killed, they drop {{Item|Dark Candy}}.

=== Vargul the Unearthed ===
{{Main|Vargul the Unearthed}}
{{NPCSprite|Vargul the Unearthed}} appears in the {{zone|Ruins}} zone during the '''Great Spook'''. Players can donate {{Item|Dark Candy}} obtained from {{MobSprite|Primal Fear;Primal Fears}} to obtain various rewards.

